      "content": "English: Shaul | French: Shaoul | Latin: Saul | Origin: &#64298;&#1464;&#1488;&#64309;&#1500; | Vietnamese: Sa-un 1 -- vua Ê-đôm, St 36,37-38 ; 1 Sb 1,48-49",
